  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan treats Red Lotus Demon Venerable’s true inheritance as the hope that can resist Heavenly Court and destroy fate Gu, and he names entry into the River of Time as the route to inherit it.",
      "chapters": [
        1585
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s time path clone steers an incomplete Immortal Gu House through the River of Time while watching Spring Autumn Cicada for a reaction. When the Gu shudders, he cuts through fog toward one site, and Ying Wu Xie names the find as a Red Lotus true inheritance when the island appears.",
      "chapters": [
        1630
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tracking-islands-in-the-river",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "inh_red_lotus_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court places time path formations that resonate with Spring Autumn Cicada and researches Red Lotus’ true inheritance from that Gu as a starting point. Fang Yuan expects to fight that defense line in the river if he wants the inheritance that may hold a path against fate Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1634
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tracking-islands-in-the-river",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Red Lotus Demon Venerable builds the first and most important stone lotus island around rank eight regret Gu for an otherworldly demon with the greatest hope of destroying Fate, and leaves true meaning, time path immortal materials, and immortal killer moves there. Fang Yuan arrives; Red Lotus’ true meaning welcomes him and tells him to accept the true inheritance, and he refines regret Gu on the spot.",
      "chapters": [
        1678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "on-the-stone-lotus-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_regret_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1679 is titled Red Lotus’ True Inheritance. Over the following days he absorbs Red Lotus’ true meaning, raising his time path attainment to quasi-supreme grandmaster, and the inheritance also supplies time path materials and killer moves built around Spring Autumn Cicada, but it does not hand him a shortcut to destroy fate Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "on-the-stone-lotus-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1694 is titled Contesting For Red Lotus’ True Inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "on-the-stone-lotus-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Longevity Heaven later contest a second stone lotus island that Heavenly Court has trapped. Feng Jiu Ge destroys that island with winds of assimilation rather than let Fang Yuan take it. The result is neither victory nor defeat: Fang Yuan keeps the inheritance he already holds in secret, Heavenly Court gains nothing from that island, and both sides leave the river.",
      "chapters": [
        1697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "on-the-stone-lotus-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the contest for the Red Lotus true inheritance, Fang Yuan neither won nor lost.",
      "chapters": [
        1703
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "on-the-stone-lotus-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
